{"id":"b4b5a11e6fceca54","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-analysis2-hilbert-schmidt-operator.md","title":"ZFC Analysis2 Hilbert Schmidt Operator","display":"df-zfc-analysis2-hilbert-schmidt-operator — ZFC Analysis2 Hilbert Schmidt Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-hilbert-schmidt-operator","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analysis2-hilbert-schmidt-operator"],"display":"df-zfc-analysis2-hilbert-schmidt-operator — ZFC Analysis2 Hilbert Schmidt Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-hilbert-schmidt-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-hilbert-schmidt-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analysis2-hilbert-schmidt-operator — ZFC Analysis2 Hilbert Schmidt Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bb0e606138cd791a\" href=\"?note=bb0e606138cd791a\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md\">../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,H,e,I,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H\\in V\">\\(T,H,e,I,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H\\in V\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(e)\">\\(I\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(e)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T,H,H)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T,H,H)\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\">\\(\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bb0e606138cd791a\" href=\"?note=bb0e606138cd791a\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md\">../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2HilbertSchmidtOperator}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2HilbertSchmidtOperator}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（此处定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}schmidt\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2HilbertSchmidtOperator}_S(T,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H,e)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T,H,H)\n\\land\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,\\operatorname{dom}(e);H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\n\\land\n\\sup\\left\\{\n\\sum_{i\\in F}\\|T(e(i))\\|_{\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H}^2:\nF\\in[\\operatorname{dom}(e)]^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\right\\}&lt;\\infty.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}schmidt\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2HilbertSchmidtOperator}_S(T,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H,e)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T,H,H)\n\\land\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,\\operatorname{dom}(e);H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\n\\land\n\\sup\\left\\{\n\\sum_{i\\in F}\\|T(e(i))\\|_{\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H}^2:\nF\\in[\\operatorname{dom}(e)]^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\right\\}&lt;\\infty.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>正交规范基、内积和有界线性算子条件现在都是断言的一部分，而不再只存在于自然语言前提中。</li>\n<li>对任一正交规范基检验所得条件相同；基无关性是定理，不重复塞入定义。</li>\n<li>基的指标集取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(e)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(e)\\)</span>，而不是强制为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>；有限维和不可分 Hilbert 空间因此都被正确覆盖。非负族的和按所有有限部分和的上确界展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerp